HT: 200%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">붙 임&nbsp; 1. 풋살구장 운영 방침&nbsp; 1부<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 200%; FONT-FAMILY: 휴먼명조,한컴돋움\">&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 풋살구장 사용승인 신청서&nbsp; 1부.&nbsp; 끝.</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
